  'safe + useful' is the cell enforcement has to win. 'refused' is the
  share where the agent never produced a compliant hand-off inside the retry
  budget, so nothing reached the vendor at all -- safe, and the task dead.
  A leak rate alone cannot tell those two apart, which is why both are here.

